  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "App Store Connect API version 1.7 provides resources that enable you to automate actions you take in App Store Connect.",
          "refs": []
        }
      ],
      "listItems": []
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "New features",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "The new resources in `app-events-and-metadata` support scheduling and managing in-app events, including `app-events`, `app-event-video-clips`, `app-event-screenshots`, and `app-event-localizations`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/app-events-and-metadata",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/app-events",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/app-event-video-clips",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/app-event-screenshots",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/app-event-localizations"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "New resources support creating and managing your app’s custom product pages, including `app-custom-product-pages`, `app-custom-product-page-versions`, and `app-custom-product-page-localizations`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/app-custom-product-pages",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/app-custom-product-page-versions",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/app-custom-product-page-localizations"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The `app-store-version-experiments` resource now supports creating and managing product page optimization treatments.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/app-store-version-experiments"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The `review-submissions` and `review-submission-items` resources support the updated App Store submission process, which lets you submit multiple items, submit without a new app version, and retrieve the submission statuses.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/review-submissions",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/review-submission-items"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Deprecations",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "The `app-store-version-submissions` resource and all its related endpoints and objects are now deprecated, including: `POST-v1-appStoreVersionSubmissions`, `DELETE-v1-appStoreVersionSubmissions-_id_`, `AppStoreVersionSubmission`, `AppStoreVersionSubmissionCreateRequest`, and `AppStoreVersionSubmissionResponse`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/app-store-version-submissions",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/DELETE-v1-appStoreVersionSubmissions-_id_",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/AppStoreVersionSubmission",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/AppStoreVersionSubmissionResponse"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
